{"page":563,"verses":[{"verse_key":"67:13","surah":67,"ayah":13,"ar_uthmani":"وَأَسِرُّوا۟ قَوْلَكُمْ أَوِ ٱجْهَرُوا۟ بِهِۦٓ ۖ إِنَّهُۥ عَلِيمٌۢ بِذَاتِ ٱلصُّدُورِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Whether you keep your words secret or state them openly, He knows the contents of every heart.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَسِرُّوا۟","en_gloss":"And conceal","transliteration":"wa-asirrū","verse_key":"67:13"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَوْلَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your speech","transliteration":"qawlakum","verse_key":"67:13"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَوِ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"awi","verse_key":"67:13"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱجْهَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"proclaim","transliteration":"ij'harū","verse_key":"67:13"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِهِۦٓ ۖ","en_gloss":"it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"67:13"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, He","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"67:13"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلِيمٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is the) All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"67:13"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِذَاتِ","en_gloss":"of what (is in)","transliteration":"bidhāti","verse_key":"67:13"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلصُّدُورِ","en_gloss":"the breasts","transliteration":"l-ṣudūri","verse_key":"67:13"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١٣","en_gloss":"(13)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"67:13"}]},{"verse_key":"67:14","surah":67,"ayah":14,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَا يَعْلَمُ مَنْ خَلَقَ وَهُوَ ٱللَّطِيفُ ٱلْخَبِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"How could He who created not know His own creation, when He is the Most Subtle, the All Aware?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَا","en_gloss":"Does not","transliteration":"alā","verse_key":"67:14"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","verse_key":"67:14"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَنْ","en_gloss":"(the One) Who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"67:14"},{"pos":4,"ar":"خَلَقَ","en_gloss":"created","transliteration":"khalaqa","verse_key":"67:14"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"67:14"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّطِيفُ","en_g