5)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"67:15"}]},{"verse_key":"67:16","surah":67,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"ءَأَمِنتُم مَّن فِى ٱلسَّمَآءِ أَن يَخْسِفَ بِكُمُ ٱلْأَرْضَ فَإِذَا هِىَ تَمُورُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Are you sure that He who is in Heaven will not make the earth swallow you up with a violent shudder?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ءَأَمِنتُم","en_gloss":"Do you feel secure","transliteration":"a-amintum","verse_key":"67:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَّن","en_gloss":"(from Him) Who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"67:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"67:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","en_gloss":"the heaven","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"67:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"67:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَخْسِفَ","en_gloss":"He will cause to swallow","transliteration":"yakhsifa","verse_key":"67:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِكُمُ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"bikumu","verse_key":"67:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍa","verse_key":"67:16"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"67:16"},{"pos":10,"ar":"هِىَ","en_gloss":"it","transliteration":"hiya","verse_key":"67:16"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَمُورُ","en_gloss":"sways","transliteration":"tamūru","verse_key":"67:16"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٦","en_gloss":"(16)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"67:16"}]},{"verse_key":"67:17","surah":67,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"أَمْ أَمِنتُم مَّن فِى ٱلسَّمَآءِ أَن يُرْسِلَ عَلَيْكُمْ حَاصِبًا ۖ فَسَتَعْلَمُونَ كَيْفَ نَذِيرِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Are you sure that He who is in Heaven will not send a whirlwind to pelt you with stones? You will come to know what My warning means.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"67:17"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَمِنتُم","en_gloss":"do you feel secure","transliteration":"amintum","verse_key":"67:17"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَّن","en_gloss":"(fr